msgid "Only if."
msgstr "仅当条件满足。"

msgid "Alice wants to pay Bob in BTC. Only if a Bitcoin condition is met."
msgstr "Alice 想用 BTC 向 Bob 付款，但前提是满足一项 Bitcoin 条件。"

msgid "See how an agreement works"
msgstr "了解协议如何运作"

msgid "Bitcoin alone cannot run the whole agreement. BATHRON verifies the Bitcoin fact and settles the intermediate leg; a provider handles the BTC leg."
msgstr "仅靠 Bitcoin 无法执行整个协议。BATHRON 验证 Bitcoin 事实并结算中间环节；服务商负责 BTC 环节。"

msgid "Bitcoin facts without an oracle."
msgstr "无需预言机的 Bitcoin 事实。"

msgid "Proof of work and transaction evidence, checked by every node."
msgstr "每个节点都验证工作量证明和交易证据。"

msgid "Explore Bitcoin facts"
msgstr "探索 Bitcoin 事实"

msgid "Programmable settlement."
msgstr "可编程结算。"

msgid "Compose covenants, hashlocks and timelocks into an agreement."
msgstr "将 covenants、hashlocks 和 timelocks 组合成协议。"

msgid "Explore the primitives"
msgstr "探索基础原语"

msgid "Open markets."
msgstr "开放市场。"

msgid "A pair exists because someone quotes it."
msgstr "只要有人报价，交易对就存在。"

msgid "Understand markets"
msgstr "了解市场"

msgid "Direct pairs"
msgstr "直接交易对"

msgid "Through M1"
msgstr "通过 M1"

msgid "Five assets need ten direct pairs, or five connections through M1."
msgstr "五种资产需要十个直接交易对，或通过 M1 建立五条连接。"

msgid "N × (N − 1) / 2"
msgstr "N × (N − 1) / 2"

